 "_comment": [
  "Implication graph: entries the game hands you automatically once you have",
  "done something else. A target is satisfied when ALL of its sources are.",
  "Targets become read-only in the UI and are computed, never ticked by hand,",
  "so one boss kill no longer means four checkboxes.",
  "",
  "Reference syntax:",
  "  'section|Item'                 unique item name within a section",
  "  'section|Group|Item'           when the name repeats in that section",
  "  'group:section|Group'          every item in that group",
  "  {'ref': '...', 'atLeast': N}   a tally that must reach N",
  "",
  "Deliberately NOT derived — 'any of' relations, where a tick cannot be",
  "traced back to one unambiguous cause:",
  "  ach|Elden Lord      any of four endings",
  "  ach|Great Rune      any one Divine Tower restoration",
  "  ach|Roundtable Hold, ach|Erdtree Aflame   no tracked prerequisite"
 ],
